window.products.push({"id":566436,"name":"12 Pack Fairy Lights Battery Operated Changing Twinkle Lights 20LEDs 7ft Flexible Silver Wire Waterproof Firefly Starry Moon String Lights for Party W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811AKmpM6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your life and home with the 12 pack battery operated LED fairy lights, In the darkness, a cluster of yellow lights flickered, like a flower bud dreaming of full bloom. At night, fairy lights seem like stars twinkling in the sky. These room starry lights decor look like stars, decorate your girls' or boys' rooms to enjoy ambience of relaxing family time, decorate your wedding to memorize your important and romantic moment Use these cute little lights to decorate your party, creating joyful atmosphere, decorate holidays and Christmas, thanksgiving, Halloween, easter, valentine to enjoy happy times, or put these led starry string lights in the glass jar, vase, or shape it around wreaths, trees, flowers, and almost everything else Warm notice:  1. The light string can be immersed in water, but battery box is not waterproof and can't be immersed in water. 2. To change battery, use the included screwdriver to open the battery pack and make sure you put the batteries in correct position.  Package included  12 X fairy lights with CR2032 batteries 1 X screwdriver Features: ① Small and portable ② Easy to shape ③ Safe to touch ④ Waterproof ⑥ Low energy consumption ⑦ Changing Twinkle Lights, 8 Modes setting(combination, in waves, sequential, slogs, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, and steady on Specifications: ① Led Color: Warm White ② Led Quantity: 20 leds ③ Waterproof: IP55 ④ String Length: 7 feet ⑤ Battery Type: CR2032  Package Included: 12 × Micro Fairy String Lights with CR2032 batteries Note:","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811AKmpM6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OakHaomie","source_asin":"B0B9L5GQ2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9L5GQ2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9L5GQ2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":566437,"name":"SHUOTAO Artificial Flowers Silk Fake Lily Rose Flowers for DIY 18 Heads Blooming Faux Flower Bouquet with Stem Home Table Vase Wedding Party Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lE2RuSnjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Package】: Total 2 pieces come in a pack; Two pieces include：6 Blooming Roses + 6 Lily + 6 Hydrangea + 54 pcs leafs. 【Material】：Silk flowers head and leaves .The stem is made of metal wire wrapped by plastic. You can bend it as you want. 【Size】: Diameter -- Blooming Rose Head ：W * H : 2.76 * 2 inch. Hydrangea：W * H : 3.15 * 2.36 inch. Lily：W * H : 3.9 * 2.76 inch. Total：14.2 * 9 inch. Part of the middle of the bouquet is stuck with small foam, and part of it may fall off during transportation. This is normal and does not affect use. 【Feature】: 1.Realistic looking:--The colors of the roses are subtle so they look real. Advanced technology gives them the look of fresh roses. 2.Never fade: Flowers can keep their fresh color for a long time. If you like flowers, but don't have time to take care of them. These would be good choices. 3.Easy to clean-this artificial flower can be cleaned with water and dried naturally. 【Application】: Artificial flowers fit for wedding bridal shower bouquets and flowers decor, centerpieces, home indoor and garden outdoor decoration, office, party, anniversary, cemetery, Valentine's Day and Christmas decorations. that enables you to enjoy poetic homelife in your kitchen, windowsill, living room, dining table, bedroom, front porch, garden, veranda, balcony with these silk flowers. 【Warm tips】: Artificial flowers may be squeezed and deformed in transit, but it will be recover with slight adjustment after displaying it. You can also use boiled water to smoke deformed flowers, use the hair dryer with cold wind to dry it. We bent the stem of the bouquet for shipping reasons. This stem can be bent at will, and it can be used normally when it is straightened.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lE2RuSnjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHUOTAO","source_asin":"B0BWR3WWKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWR3WWKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWR3WWKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
