window.products.push({"id":566440,"name":"AnBnCn Porcelain Salad Soup Bowls,64 oz White Serving Bowls, Large Cereal Bowls for Kitchen, Dishwasher and Microwave Safe, 8 Inch, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s7sM23mGL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","description":"🥗64-oz, 8-inch(W) x 3-inch(H), 4-Pack - amazing capacity, a great size for soup, pasta, vegetables, large amounts of cereals, salad, rice, fruit, etc. 🥗Considerate design - the bowl has a wide opening with proper depth so this large bowl can be easily washed in the dishwasher. It is convenient to stack up and store, it can also stack with multiple pieces steadily because the bottom is wide enough and it won't be accidentally knocked over. 🥗Easy to Care - High quality porcelain bowl, healthy glaze, easy to wash by hands or dishwasher. - Microwave, Oven, Dishwasher and Freezer safe. 🥗Reliable Quality Assurance - Crafted from AB grade porcelain fired at high temperature. These pasta bowls are sturdy and resistant against scratches and chips. 🥗AnBnCn-Sales Service - If received any defective, broken, or chipped product, please contact us immediately. We will send a replacement set to you free of charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s7sM23mGL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AnBnCn","source_asin":"B08NWVJDQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NWVJDQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NWVJDQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":566441,"name":"Gotham Steel Crisper Tray for Oven, 2 Piece Nonstick Copper Crisper Tray and Basket, Air Fry in your Oven, Great for Baking and Crispy Foods, As Seen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PRCWliATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gotham Steel Cookware: With over 30 million happy customers, Gotham Steel has revolutionized kitchens across the world with the introduction of the nonstick ceramic copper cookware! New for 2021, our frying pans have improved in every area including the nonstick coating, stay cool handles, exterior finish and durability, including infusing diamond-like particles to the surface to ensure the pan doesn’t scratch! Enjoy and welcome to the Gotham Steel family.Crisper Tray: The Gotham Steel 2 piece crisper tray and basket is the revolutionary air frying tray that you can use in your oven. The raised basket allows for the convection heat to reach every angle of the food and gives you the perfect crisp, without all the calories, every time! “Fry” French fries, tater tots, mozzarella sticks and so much moreUltimate Ceramic Nonstick: The Gotham Steel nonstick cooking surface is coated three times and then reinforced with diamonds to deliver the ultimate food release. No seasoning or even oil or butter needed, makes for healthier eating, and provides for hassle free, 1-2-3 cleanup.Healthy & Non-Toxic: The Gotham Steel Ti-Cerama coating is free of PFOA, PFOS, lead & cadmium for a healthy and safe experience day in and out.Effortless Cleanup, Dishwasher Safe: Spend less time with cleanup! After all the cooking and prepping is done, place in the dishwasher for quick and easy cleanup.Oven Safe: Compatible with all ovens and can handle up to 500 degreesEven Heat Distribution: The aluminum composition and mesh basket ensures the convection heat reaches all areas of the food and provides great results.10 Year Guarantee: Our cookware is built for years of use and backed by a 10-year limited guarantee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PRCWliATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOTHAM STEEL","source_asin":"B0C2RYDJ46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2RYDJ46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2RYDJ46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":566442,"name":"Pachysandra Terminalis 'Green Carpet' Groundcover - 200 Bare Root Plants","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":160.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cl1h58oOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"200 heavily rooted plants. 'Green Carpet' is a superior cultivar of Pachysandra terminalis that maintains a slightly more compact appearance, growing about 2 inches shorter than the species. ‘Green Carpet’ is noted for having darker green, slightly glossier foliage with a more pronounce leave serration. ‘Green Carpet’ also develops more underground stems, and therefore will fill in faster the Pachysandra terminalis. It does well in partly shaded or full shade areas. Pachysandra is the only satisfactory plant that will grow as a ground cover under Pine Trees. This plant is used extensively under shallow rooted trees, back of buildings or in other areas that are too shady for grass to grow. It is also attractive as a border plant along paths or driveway edgings. Common Name: Green Carpet Pachysandra Hardiness Zone: 5 to 9 Height: 6 to 8 inches Spread: 1 to 1.5 feet Bloom Time: April Bloom Color: White Sun: Part shade to full shade Maintenance: Low Flowers: Small, white flowers 1-2” long Leaves: Evergreen Uses: Groundcover, erosion control, border plant. For most groundcovers, we recommend you plant 6” to 9” spacing. This will allow the plants to grow together quickly, reducing the need for hand weeding. To determine how many plants you will need, using 6” spacing, multiply the number of square footage that you need to plant by 4.0. If you would like your plants to be spaced 9” apart, multiply the number of square footage by 1.8. Example: If you have a 100 square foot area to plant and you would like your plants to be planted 6” apart, you will need to calculate 100 x 4.0 = 400. 400 is the approximate number of plants needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cl1h58oOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Groundcover","source_asin":"B00ES1U836","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ES1U836","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ES1U836","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
