window.products.push({"id":566463,"name":"Dish Drying Rack, Kitchen Counter Dish Drainer Rack Auto-Drain, Expandable (14.8 to 22.2 inch) Rustproof Aluminium Large Sink Dish Strainer with Dish ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ilw-xtolL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Expand and Retract Design】The dish drying rack slides into a compact form for when you only have a few things to hand wash, but expands to almost double the size when you need additional space. The dish rack suits both large families' kitchens and small apartment kitchens, even RV countertops. The dish drainer rack expands from 14.8\" to 22.2 inches. Dimensions: From 14.8\" to 22.2\" (L) x 12.1\" (W) x 4.4\" (H). 【Rustproof Aluminium Material】No Rust, Made of a high-grade aluminum frame, The dish rack for kitchen counter is more sturdy and long-lasting than other stainless steel, iron, and bamboo material. 【Fast Drainage】The dish drainer for kitchen counter has 2 built-in incline drainboards and a spout that makes the water literally run into your sink off your dishes and pots and pans. The utensil holder has an Independent drain spout so the silverware will drain faster to the sink than the dishes. 【Dish Size & Large Capacity】Manufacturers suggest drying dish size is 8 to 11 inches in diameter and thickness is 1 inch. The dish drying rack with drainboard has a large capacity and can store most of the kitchenware, such as plates, bowls, mugs, cups, thin pans, pot lids, and bottles. The removable utensil holder can organize forks, knives, chopsticks, scissors, etc. 【Anti-slip Legs & Drying Mat】The Anti-slip silicone legs would be helpful so you could add enough tilt so the water would run out and not pool in the rack and allow enough height to get above the edge of the sink. Put an extra dish drying mat to collect splash water to make the countertop dry and neat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ilw-xtolL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAYZH","source_asin":"B0C28PTJZ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C28PTJZ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C28PTJZ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
