window.products.push({"id":566473,"name":"SHUAFA LED Mirror for Bathroom, 28x36 Inch Backlit + Front Lighted Bathroom Mirror with Lights, High-Density Double Light Strips, 3 Colors, Shatter-Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E4Le4UZqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 ETL Quality & Backlit+Front Light】This LED mirror for bathroom is ETL certified, meeting safety standards. The power supply and LED lights are UL listed and have a lifespan of more than 50,000 hours. It features built-in two IP54 waterproof LED light strips that provide both backlit and front light. The mirror is made of 4mm thinner shatter-proof tempered glass, offering high and robust quality with a lighter overall weight compared to ordinary LED mirrors. 【Excellent Design & High Lumen】A design of high-density 240 LEDs/m light strips offers nearly twice as much brightness as other mirrors that use 120 LEDs/m strips. CRI>95 brings high-definition imaging. SHUAFA bathroom mirror with lights will give you super bright illumination for shaving, makeup, grooming and skincare. 【Anti-fog & Automatic Power-off Protection】With upgraded anti-fog film, the fog-proof surface occupies 60% of the mirror, larger than other led mirrors. The mirror’s defogger and light switches can be controlled separately. Users can turn on the defogger switch for only 5-10 minutes to ensure a clear reflection. The power will automatically turn off after over one hour of continuous work to prevent overheating. 【3 Color Lighting and Brightness Dimmable】This multi-functional bathroom vanity mirror has 3 color temperature lights: warm(3000K), natural (4500K) and white(6000K).The brightness of the light can be adjusted from 10% to 100% with a touch sensor button on the mirror. The memory function allows the last color temperature and brightness set to be recalled when you turn on the button to avoid the trouble of repeated adjustment. 【Easy Installation】This mirror can be installed with hard-wire/plug 2 ways, we suggest connecting the wall switch to control the mirror. All the installation accessories are included.It's convenient for you to install within 15 minutes. 【Packaging & 5-Year Warranty】The upgraded packaging of SHUAFA LED bathroom mirrors has passed all tests, including dropping, impact, heavy pressure etc. A 5-year warranty is provided for any defective products. A full refund or free replacement will be provided if there is any damage upon arrival without returning the defective one, but relevant photos via Amazon Message. Please get in touch with us to report every problem found, we will offer the best solution within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E4Le4UZqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHUAFA","source_asin":"B0C4LD419G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4LD419G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4LD419G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
