window.products.push({"id":566485,"name":"Britta Products YSS-01 24 Mini Glowing LED Solar String Holiday Lights, 18-Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SBHizt5jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Mini Glowing Colored Solar Strings add atmosphere to any outdoor space. The set consists of twenty-four (24), 7/8\" (23mm) ABS balls wrapped with UV-resistant colored thread that are waterproof, spaced along a 16' length of wire. Powered by a compact solar panel equipped with an easy-to-use ground spike. The thread-wrapped colored balls are spaced at about a 7.5\" interval, the 24 balls cover a length of 16'. An additional 3.5' of waterproof wire connects the solar panel to the string permitting you to find an ideal sunny spot to locate the solar panel. At dusk, the spheres glow brightly with a surprisingly bright colored light that adds fun to any surroundings. Inside each colored ball is a matching colored LED and this combination creates an extra dramatic colored light effect. (The solar panel has two modes: normal and flashing) The solar panel uses a high quality amorphous type panel and an internal 800mA NiMH battery to provide many hours of illumination. Fully waterproof, the panel and colored balls look great when placed in trees, along fences or gates, from a trellis or anywhere you're adding atmosphere and elegance to an outdoor space. Powered by the sun, the lamps illuminate automatically at dusk. With good sun exposure, expect 7 to 8 hours of illumination or more, as performance is directly related to the amount of sunshine received (summer sun results in the lamps glowing for over 10 hours). We love our Mini Glowing Colored Solar Strings and know you will too. See all our solar products on our Amazon store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SBHizt5jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Britta Products","source_asin":"B007XVYULE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007XVYULE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007XVYULE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
