window.products.push({"id":566551,"name":"CHEVNI Queen Mattress, 12 Inch Hybrid Mattress with Individually Pocket Springs,Dual Layer Memory Foam, Medium Firm Hybrid Mattress in a Box, Euro Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IyhbNFkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"** Breathable Mattress Design ** : All size mattress are designed with soft knit fabric on the top cover which is breathable and skin-friendly.High density memory foam under the cover promotes air flow when sleeping on this King size mattress.Breathable surface keep cooling all night long. ** Safety and Comfortable ** : All size mattress are crafted for safety, durability, received the International Chiropractors Association's endorsement and can help people achieve a healthier sleep life. Made without harmful substances, our memory foam and fabrics comply with all applicable mandatory and voluntary safety standards for mattress products. ** Low Motion Transfer High Quality Individuall Pocket Springs ** : The inside of the spring mattress is composed of isolated pocket springs to prevent the spring from aging and prolong the life of the spring. The independent pocket spring mattress makes the body's force more balanced, can relieve the pressure on the body, and bring you a good night's sleep. ** High Density Foam with CertiPUR-US Certified ** : All sizes mattresses are covered by good-quality knitted fabrics and multiple layers of hign quality memory foam which is ventilated and breathable.All memory foams are certified by CertiPUR-US. Better choice for family. ** Bed Mattress in a Box and 10 Years Warranty** : All sizes hybrid mattress are rolled and compressed in a box for shipping, set up easy and fun, unseal the mattress and let it inflate for about 72 hours to enable full expansion. They are compatible with most of bed frames, such as foundation, slatted base, flat platform bed or floor.Free For 10 years limited warranty against manufacturer defects.Please feel free to contact us anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IyhbNFkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEVNI","source_asin":"B0B3GF8PQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3GF8PQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3GF8PQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
