window.products.push({"id":566619,"name":"Deluxe Non Stick Pan 9.5\" Induction Nonstick Frying Pan with Lid Stainless Steel Kitchen Cookware Stay-Cool Handle Skillet for Induction/Electric Stov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+UyvqL0UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[PFOA/PFTE FREE] ♥ The inner surface of the nonstick frying pan is spray safety coating free of PFOA, PFTE, which is not release chemical gas on high temperature while cooking. Skillet is an ideal selection to fry hamburgers, steaks, eggs, etc [SPECIAL IN INDUCTION SKILLET] ♥ The impact-bonded base of non stick pan is made of the newly developed TH1 constant temperature technology materials, which is special in induction cooker. The highest temperature would not over 446℉（230℃）only when stainless steel pan use on induction cooker. Of course, all though it can be compatible with other stoves such as gas, ceramic ,electric and so on, but it will be a normal nonstick pan without features control temperature [HEALTHY COOKING] ♥ DELUXE cook pan with lid is very convenient to fry eggs, steak, hambugers etc. on all kinds of stoves such as electric, gas, ceramic, halogen and induction. The food is hard to burning and carbonize when frying, it is great to maintaining various nutrients of the ingredients to the greatest extent, preserve to the moisture, keeping the original flavor of the ingredients [STAY-COOL STEEL HANDLE] ♥ The joints of stainless steel pot and handle is reinforced by rivet technology which is firm and hard to fall off, so you can easily pour food; and when you grip handle you will feel the handle still stay cool when cooking thanks to design of hollow handle. And there are also a small hole on the handle top that you can hang pan on the wall to save the storge space. In addtion, the pot has one glass lid which help to control the status of food while cooking [EASY TO CLEAN] ♥ The first time to use the non stick skillet, please remove any label on the package and then wash it with kitchen detergent and water. After clean, please dry skillet with soft dishcloth to begin the first cooking with this new non stick pan. And any grease and oil can be easily to remove after cooking by water and kitchen detergent. All though the pan is dishwasher safe, we are recommend it hand wash to protect","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+UyvqL0UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe","source_asin":"B09ZQGJY55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQGJY55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQGJY55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
