window.products.push({"id":566764,"name":"SOMYTING Artificial Christmas Wreath, 24” Large Pre-Lit Christmas Front Door Wreath with Red Bells, Red Berries, Pine Cones,Ball Ornaments Handcrafted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gC2-bQtHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Christmas Wreath Size】-- Our Christmas wreath for front door measures approx. 24 inch / 60 cm.(from the widest to the widest). Inner grapevine wreath base measures approx. 11.8 inch / 30 cm. Weights: 3 pounds / 1340g. Ideal size, superior texture and sturdy construction, a must-have door wreath for this Christmas holiday. 【Handcrafts with High Quality】-- Artificial Christmas door wreath is made from foam berries picks, PU magnolia leaves, mixed types of plastic pine needles, PE spruce, red plastic ball ornaments, metal bells, natural pine cones and sturdy rattan hoop. Luxuriant, durable, and lifelike. No fade in the winter wind and snow, no wither, no need special maintenance. Great value to use for many Christmas days to come. 【Battery Operated Lighting Wreath】-- We pre-install a string of 50 warm white led lights and a waterproof battery case on the branch which makes the Christmas wreath look bright and splendid even in the nights. Those led lights are powered by 3 AA batteries and provides 2 light modes: flashy mode and steady on mode. Note: batteries are not included in the package. 【Gorgeous Christmas Decorations】-- Our stunning, full and lush Winter wreath will create wonderful memories for your family and friends. It goes well with various decoration style, suitable for both indoor and outdoor, festivals, party, weddings, Thanksgiving, Christmas and all seasons decorations. You can hang it on your front door, windows, behind on the fireplace, living room wall to add a warm and festive touch to your decoration. 【Guarantee】-- Merry Christmas and Happy New Year! SOMYTING has been dedicated to offer high quality, unique style home ornaments and high efficiency, thoughtful customer services. If you have any questions about our artificial Christmas wreath, please feel free to contact us. Hope you’re happy with the purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gC2-bQtHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOMYTING","source_asin":"B0B9BX8DNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BX8DNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BX8DNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
