window.products.push({"id":566839,"name":"Gig Collections Ice Cream Container - 1.5 Quart Insulated Homemade Gelato Tub with Stackable Non-Slip Silicone Base - Complete with Frozen Yogurt Sorb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZSm5VhVCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gig Collections Ice Cream Container with Scoop Homemade Fun Enjoy making delicious homemade ice cream with family and friends in the comfort of your own home. We pride ourselves on providing high quality products and the Gig Collections Ice Cream Tub is no exception. Go on - have fun and become a master Sorbet maker with the 1.5 quart capacity containers. Premium Quality The tubs are made from high quality materials and are safe to use with any general food types. The insulated container retain and maintain the ideal temperature when serving to ensure the ice cream doesn't melt immediately. The tight fitting lid has been designed to protect the food content from freezer burn. The tubs are dishwasher friendly for a quick and effortless wash. Space Saver The tubs for homemade ice cream includes a non-slip base made of silicone. This silicone strips ensures easy stacking without the fear they might all come tumbling down. Easily stack multiple containers on top of each other to ensure maximum usage of space in your fridge and freezer. Versatile The tubs can be used for various occasions. Not only do they store food, but they can also be used to serve food in. The beautiful aesthetic appearance will look great on any table. They are perfect for storing multiple food types, including soups, stews, sauces, gravies - basically any freezable foods. All-in-One Set This all-in-one combo also includes a ice cream scoop. Use the scoop to create perfectly round ice balls. The scoop will speed up your service time which is ideal when hosting big parties for kids or even adults. For best results, dip the scoop in hot water to create smooth ice cream balls. What's Included? - 2 x Ice Cream Containers - 1 x Ice Cream Scoop","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZSm5VhVCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gig Collections","source_asin":"B09754BPNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09754BPNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09754BPNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
