window.products.push({"id":566870,"name":"Golden Girl Oven Mitts and Pot Holders, Heat Resistant Oven Mitts Soft Cotton Lining and Non-Slip Surface Safe for Baking, Cooking, BBQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bpHnDbgAS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SAY GOODBYE TO BURNS AND STEAM SCALDSHeat Resistant - The oven mitts and pot holders heat resistant up to 360 F/ 260C.The mitts size are 10.6 x 6.7 inches .It's good to protect your arm from burns. The potholders are 7.1 x 7.1 inches.This oven glove can meet your daily cooking needs.Convenient to use - Oven gloves are designed to make it easier to remove food from the oven or microwave.They are suitable for your both hands .And potholders can be used to take soup pans.Use to hold hot pots, pans, plates, bowls and trays, and also place any hot item straight from the stove top, microwave or oven onto the pot holder. Make the most of your imagination using it.Each oven mitt features a cotton loop inside so they can be hung in a cabinet, near the grill or in a pantry.Our gloves not only provide generous protection for your hands, but also your arms, which can protect your arms from being scalded when handling high temperature items. The longer wrist protection function can protect you from the damage of your fingertips, and even prevent the wrist from slipping over. This allows you to hold the pot, pan and cookware safely without slipping or splashing.Specification:Material: Polyester fabric.Perfect Size(about): oven mitt:10.6x6.7in + square potholder:7.1x7.1in.Package Includes:1pc square potholder + 1pc oven mitt.Tips: Cleaning method, It is not waterproof and can be easily cleaned. Washing machine is not recommended. Hand washing with warm water is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bpHnDbgAS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VINMEN","source_asin":"B094JYM1RM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-566870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094JYM1RM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094JYM1RM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
